<h3><u>Mera naam Hussaini hai mera kaam hai maatam</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p dir=""ltr"">Ya Hussain</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Qariya qariya aa gaya kucha kucha gaya<br />
Har jagah zikr e aal e mohammed kiya<br />
Milgaya jis jagah mujhko farsh e aza<br />
Apni pehchan karwayi hai iss tarha<br />
Naam hai mera azadare Hussain<br />
Kaam mera maatam e Hussain hai</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Kya fikr ho duniya ki mujhe kya ho bhala gham (2)<br />
Hai saaya bhi manzar pe alamdaar ka parcham<br />
Mera naam Hussaini hai mera kaam hai maatam (2)</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Maulai mujhe ye kehta hai saara zamana<br />
Tauqeer mujhe deta hai Zehra ka gharana<br />
Kehta hai mujhe zakir e shabeer e do alam</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Hai saaya bhi manzar pe alamdaar ka parcham<br />
Mera naam Hussaini hai mera kaam hai maatam (2)</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Pehchaan meri saare zamane pe ayaan hai<br />
Sine pe mere maatam e sarwar ka nishaan hai<br />
Nauha hai hoton pe mere aur ankh meri nam</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Hai saaya bhi manzar pe alamdaar ka parcham<br />
Mera naam Hussaini hai mera kaam hai maatam (2)</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Agar chahun toh khud apni he taqdeer badal dun<br />
Pairon ke tale saare yazeedon ko kuchal dun<br />
Maatam se mujhe rokle kisme hai bhala dum</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Hai saaya bhi manzar pe alamdaar ka parcham<br />
Mera naam Hussaini hai mera kaam hai maatam (2)</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Har katra mere khoon ka deta hai gawahi<br />
Hun lashkar e shabeer ka be tegh sipahi<br />
Hun barsar e paikaar yazeedon se hum adam</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Hai saaya bhi manzar pe alamdaar ka parcham<br />
Mera naam Hussaini hai mera kaam hai maatam (2)</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Imaan bhi maatam hai ye maatam he aqida<br />
Jeena ka hunar majlis e shabeer se sikha<br />
Ye baat mere hoton pe rehti hai hum adam</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Hai saaya bhi manzar pe alamdaar ka parcham<br />
Mera naam Hussaini hai mera kaam hai maatam (2)</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Majlis he meri quld hai majlis he mera ghar<br />
Maa baap bhi aulad bhi qurban isi par<br />
Ahlan yehi tum bhi karo aur yehi gham</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Hai saaya bhi manzar pe alamdaar ka parcham<br />
Mera naam Hussaini hai mera kaam hai maatam (2)</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Ye nasl e yezidi jise kehti hai tamasha<br />
Dar asl ye maatam hai usey muh pe tamacha<br />
Fatwon ki fiza rokhna payegi ye maatam</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Hai saaya bhi manzar pe alamdaar ka parcham<br />
Mera naam Hussaini hai mera kaam hai maatam (2)</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Woh dast e bala sham e ghareeban ka andhera<br />
Kehti thi ye saidaniyon se Sani e Zehra<br />
Hai bibiyon sad shukr ke laachar nahi hum</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Hai saaya bhi manzar pe alamdaar ka parcham<br />
Mera naam Hussaini hai mera kaam hai maatam (2)</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Karbal se sue shaam chali Aal e Payambar<br />
Zainab se yehi kehne laga ye laasha e Sarwar<br />
Ye kehti chalo ay meri masooma e alam</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Hai saaya bhi manzar pe alamdaar ka parcham<br />
Mera naam Hussaini hai mera kaam hai maatam (2)</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Shehzadi e Kaunain ki ye mujh par ata hai<br />
Haathon ki lakeeron may meri ye bhi likha hai<br />
Ta hashr qalam chalta rahega mera paigham</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Hai saaya bhi manzar pe alamdaar ka parcham<br />
Mera naam Hussaini hai mera kaam hai maatam (2)</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Allah ka mazhar ye sab se bada hai<br />
Usne hume maatam ke liye paida kiya hai<br />
Farhan yehi keh ke nighahon ko karo qam</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Hai saaya bhi manzar pe alamdaar ka parcham<br />
Mera naam Hussaini hai mera kaam hai maatam (2)</p>
